&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;23.2k&lt;br&gt;A single CLAUDE.md file to improve Claude Code behavior, derived from Andrej Karpathy&amp;#39;s observations on LLM coding pitfalls.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/devv-ai/devv&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;devv&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;1.5k &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;29&lt;br&gt;An AI-powered search engine for developers.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Jiayuan Zhang 👋&lt;/h1&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Founder &amp;amp; CEO @ &lt;a href=&quot;https://multica.ai&quot;&gt;Multica&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; | 🤖 &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Builder&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;blockquote&gt; 
 &lt;p&gt;Your next 10 hires won&#39;t be human. Building the platform to make that happen.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;/blockquote&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;I build tools that integrate AI agents as real team members. &lt;a href=&quot;https://multica.ai&quot;&gt;Multica&lt;/a&gt; is an open-source platform where coding agents work alongside humans—assigned tasks, reporting progress, and shipping code just like any other colleague.&lt;/p&gt; 
