 &lt;li&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/multica-ai/multica&quot;&gt;Multica&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — Open-source platform for managing mixed human-agent engineering teams&lt;/li&gt; 
